You are transcribing the audio track of a clinical video. The video may be a consultation between a clinician and a patient or an instructional video in which a narrator demonstrates or explains a clinical examination, procedure, or exercise.

Transcribe all intelligible speech as a chronological list of segments. For each segment, give:
